    "Images and text will be sent to the current model after you send the message. Supports single-frame images up to 20 MiB and UTF-8 TXT/MD/JSON/CSV up to 256 KiB; PDF and Office files are not supported. Images are sent at a maximum dimension of 2,048 pixels. Originals stay on this device.": {
