            "value": "Subscription access applies only to authorized accounts and models, subject to plan and workspace limits. Requests send local context with store=false and stream=true. previous_response_id is not supported."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅获授权的账户／模型使用订阅额度，受套餐与工作区限制。HTTP 请求必须 store=false、stream=true，发送本地上下文；不支持 previous_response_id。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
