    "Tapping and dragging require USB HID. Screenshots do not require an ESP32 connection. The connection stays open between tasks; disconnecting stops current input. Set USB Ethernet to 192.168.7.2 with subnet mask 255.255.255.0 and leave router and DNS blank.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapping and dragging require USB HID. Screenshots do not require an ESP32 connection. The connection stays open between tasks; disconnecting stops current input. Set USB Ethernet to 192.168.7.2 with subnet mask 255.255.255.0 and leave router and DNS blank."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击和拖动需要 USB HID，截图无需连接 ESP32。任务结束后连接保持；断开会停止当前输入。USB 以太网地址 192.168.7.2，掩码 255.255.255.0，路由器与 DNS 留空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
