    "Uses location services to help tasks continue after switching apps. Requires location access while using the app. Only used during a task or background standby. Coordinates are not saved or uploaded. Shows the system location indicator and uses more battery. Other features do not require location.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses location services to help tasks continue after switching apps. Requires location access while using the app. Only used during a task or background standby. Coordinates are not saved or uploaded. Shows the system location indicator and uses more battery. Other features do not require location."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用定位服务帮助任务在切换 App 后继续，需要允许“使用 App 期间”访问位置。仅在任务运行或后台常驻时使用，不保存或上传坐标；会显示系统定位标志并增加耗电。定位不是使用其他功能的必要条件。"
          }
        }
      }
